{"id":295,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"自主創造を軸に一貫教育を行う日大藤沢","feature_description":"日本大学藤沢中学校・高等学校は、日本大学の教育理念「自主創造」を基盤に、「健康・有為・品格」の校訓を掲げます。基礎学力の向上、社会性の育成、行事や教科外活動への参加を重視し、知育・徳育・体育の均衡を図ります。併設校の特徴を生かし、小中高大16年間を見通した教育と、大学施設を使う体験的な学びを進めています。社会性や国際的素養の育成も目標に含めています。","clubs":[{"id":4401,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4402,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4403,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4404,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4405,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4406,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4407,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":4408,"name":"ウエイトリフティング部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13837,"name":"男子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13838,"name":"女子バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13839,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13840,"name":"新聞・写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.fujisawa.hs.nihon-u.ac.jp/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-16"},{"id":13841,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","sourc